<ol>
  <li><strong>Enable “Fast Forward”</strong> – If a cutscene drags on, use the built‑in speed boost to skip ahead.</li>
  <li><strong>Save States</strong> – Place a save right before a tough boss, then reload after a quick break to avoid losing progress.</li>
